  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/1d/c9/41/1dc94136fe02dcfb8bcc07dc04f16a28.png\" alt=\"侏罗纪世界重生II横幅\" width=\"1124\" height=\"591\"></p><p>‎ ‎ <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JMqZhxk7gA\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/831803522281635850?label=Discord&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=4a94fb&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"172\" height=\"24\"></a> ‎ <a href=\"https://patreon.com/KnightDexx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=KnightDexx&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\" width=\"166\" height=\"24\"></a> ‎ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fKNIGHTDEXX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Rent -a server-9cf?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Codeforces&amp;logoColor=cyan\" alt=\"租用服务器\" width=\"139\" height=\"24\"></a> ‎ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/dexxknight1/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/My-modpacks-red?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge\" alt=\"项目\" width=\"132\" height=\"24\"></a> ‎ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fdexxknight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Support me on Ko-fi&amp;color=C0C0C0&amp;labelColor=4a94fb&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=kofi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在Ko-fi上支持我\" width=\"179\" height=\"24\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmmcreviews.com%252fall%252fmodpacks%252fjurassic-world-reborn-ii%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c1ji64K.png\" alt=\"MMC评测\" width=\"390\" height=\"65\"></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🦕 欢迎来到侏罗纪世界重生II 🦕</strong></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">踏入一个让远古生命重现、史前巨兽再次行走大地的世界。<strong>侏罗纪世界重生II</strong>邀请你踏上一段穿越时空的非凡探险之旅，在这里科学与史前奇迹相遇，世界的每个角落都藏着等待发掘的新发现。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">这不仅仅是生存——这是一场史诗级别的<strong>古生物学冒险</strong>。从远古化石中提取DNA，培育数百万年来未曾在地球上漫游的生物，建造属于你自己的侏罗纪保护区。从海洋爬行动物悄然游弋的深海，到翼龙展翅高飞的天空，每一个生物群系都成为了通往地球遥远过去的一扇窗。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">但史前世界只是开始。探索神秘维度，驾驭强大科技，掌握奥术魔法，并与同行探险家结盟。你将成为著名的古生物学家、绘制未知领域的大胆冒险家，还是创造终极恐龙公园的前瞻建筑师？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">凭借增强的视觉、沉浸式环境音效和精心打造的生态系统，这个模组天堂的每一刻都像是一场真正的探险。火山在远处轰鸣，瀑布在茂密丛林中倾泻，古老生物的叫声在荒野中回荡。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>恐龙时代已经回归。你准备好响应号召了吗？</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#06c\"><strong>💻 系统要求</strong></span></h3><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>推荐内存：</strong>分配给Minecraft 16GB至20GB</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Java：</strong>需Java 17+（建议使用<a href=\"https://github.com/TheUsefulLists/UsefulMods/blob/main/JavaArgumentsOptimization.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">优化Java参数</a>以获得最佳性能）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>OptiFine：</strong>❌ 不兼容此整合包（通过Oculus/Rubidium包含光影）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Minecraft版本：</strong>1.20.1 Forge</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/b4/98/40/b4984061a92d4685ff76ac6302586825.png\" alt=\"特色横幅\" width=\"870\" height=\"126\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#c00\"><strong>🎯 侏罗纪世界重生II的特别之处？</strong></span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🦖 史前生物与恐龙</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>超过560个模组</strong>精心挑选，打造终极侏罗纪体验</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jurassic-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jurassic Reborn (JR)</a> - 包含<strong>108种不同生物</strong>，包括恐龙、海洋爬行动物、史前鱼类和基因杂交品种</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fossils\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fossils &amp; Archeology</a> - 超过<strong>60种史前生物</strong>，可通过考古发掘复活</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">提取DNA、孵化蛋并培育自己的史前伙伴</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">创建定制栖息地，观察逼真的恐龙行为</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🌍 可探索的维度</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮色森林</a> - 充满神秘与远古遗迹的魔法林地王国</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">深渊花园</a> - 基岩之下拥有独特生态系统的广阔地下维度</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">蔚蓝天空</a> - 两个天界领域：永昼之地和永曙之地，浮空岛屿点缀其间</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多充满史前秘密与宝藏的维度等待发现！</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🔍 探索与冒险</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">发现埋藏在世界各处的隐藏<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/treasure2\" rel=\"nofollow\">宝藏</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">探索神秘地牢与废弃建筑</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">揭开沉船和水下考古遗址的秘密</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lootr\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lootr</a> - 多人服务器上每位玩家独特的个性化战利品系统</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reskillable-reimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reskillable</a> - 最多<strong>8种自定义技能</strong>，实现角色成长</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>✨ 魔法与神秘学</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">植物魔法</a> - 自然魔法与魔力操控</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">新生艺技</a> - 可自定义的咒语制作系统</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/psi\" rel=\"nofollow\">PSI</a> - 通过可视化编程创建可编程法术</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">驾驭魔法能量以增强你的史前探险</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>⚔️ 武器、盔甲与工具</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴达武器</a> - 多样化的近战与远程武器库</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" rel=\"nofollow\">永恒经典零式火器</a> - 用于自卫的现代枪械</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinkers-construct\" rel=\"nofollow\">匠魂</a> - 自定义工具锻造与材料组合</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">抵御具有攻击性的史前掠食者与敌对探险家</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🏛️ 装饰与建造</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/decocraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Decocraft</a> - 数千种装饰物用于点缀你的基地</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/engineers-decor-ported\" rel=\"nofollow\">工程师装饰（移植版）</a> - 工业主题装饰品</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisel-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">凿子重生</a> - 数百种方块变体</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">凿子与碎块</a> - 用于精细设计的微块建造</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/building-but-better\" rel=\"nofollow\">建造改进</a> - 强化建造选项</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bibliocraft-legacy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bibliocraft经典版</a> - 家具与存储方案</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">建造终极恐龙公园、研究设施或史前博物馆！</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>💎 独特神器与遗物</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\">神器</a> - 具有特殊能力的可穿戴强力物品</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">遗物</a> - 带有神秘特性的远古宝藏</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">揭开赋予非凡力量的传奇物品</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">组合神器以创造终极探险家装备</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>📦 存储方案</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">应用能源2</a> - 高级数字存储网络</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\">汤姆简易存储</a> - 易于使用的物品管理</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/storage-drawers\" rel=\"nofollow\">存储抽屉</a> - 紧凑的大容量存储</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\">精密存储</a> - 可升级的存储容器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">精密背包</a> - 可升级的便携存储</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">高效整理你的化石、DNA样本与史前发现</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style